<title>SPAIN: Spain's Banesto 9-mth pre-tax profit rises 38 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Banesto 9-mth pre-tax profit rises 38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first nine months 1996 in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			   22.86    vs     16.55</p>
<p> Net interest income		   96.30    vs     99.66</p>
<p> Ordinary margin			139.07    vs    133.83</p>
<p> Operating profit			30.75    vs     22.71</p>
<p> Fee income				35.72    vs     34.33</p>
<p> Other financial/trading income    10.86    vs	3.22</p>
<p> Bad/doubtful debt charge	    12.14    vs	9.58</p>
<p> Extraordinary gains		   30.00    vs     11.06</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the bank is Grupo Banco Espanol de Credito-Banesto SA. It is owned by Banco Santander SA</p>
</text>
